{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225600","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222560001:0":{"text":"이제 내 차례군.","source_cn":"这次该到我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75B6B85EFB897C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222560002:0":{"text":"타시가 내 소원으로 얼마나 짜릿한 광경을 만들어낼지 모르니 다들 조심해! 어쩌면 난 세상을 구하는 영웅이 될지도 모른다고!","source_cn":"你们小心点，都往后站。不知道塔西会用我的心愿做出多惊险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14902BF060155B47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222560003:0":{"text":"와, 진짜요?!","source_cn":"哇，真的吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9D7B2DDE17D441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222560004:0":{"text":"후후, 신밧드의 꿈을 본 적이 있는데 확실히 온갖 색으로 반짝반짝하더라고요! 정말 놀라웠어요.","source_cn":"哼哼，我见过辛巴达的梦哦，确实绚烂多彩变化万千，比吟游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE410E9011F66CC55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222560005:0":{"text":"하지만 그게 정말로 당신의 마음속 가장 깊은 곳의 소원일까요?","source_cn":"不过，那真的是你心中最深层的愿望吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x329A36ADD2C2E495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222560006:1":{"text":"두고 보자고요!","source_cn":"让我们拭目以待——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026D14BDEFC8D15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1222561001:":{"text":"신밧드, 모두가 너를 위해서 준비한 거야.","source_cn":"辛巴达，这是大家给你准备的","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D5F48DC1AE29DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1222561002:":{"text":"모험을 떠나더라도 우리를 잊지 말렴.","source_cn":"就算去冒险，也别忘了我们","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3739306FF76B470F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222560007:0":{"text":"베시, 루시? 여긴 어떻게...","source_cn":"碧希和鲁西？！怎么会是她们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E1FC6EDC912049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222560008:0":{"text":"어라, 스몰워터 마을 사람들이네요...","source_cn":"咦，是小水村的人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0B9E08F21C22C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222560009:1":{"text":"치피가 냄비 속에서 음식 냄새를 맡았어요!","source_cn":"满满闻到了，锅里飘来了食物的香味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8DFBD5E172EBFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222560010:0":{"text":"채소랑 치즈 냄새야... 어렸을 때 항상 그걸로 저녁을 만들어 주곤 했거든.","source_cn":"那是野菜和芝士的味道……小时候她们常常给我用那些食材做晚饭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC470D6D4DF66D504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222560011:1":{"text":"마을 밖 숲에서 가져온 신선한 채소와 직접 잡은 생선, 그리고 러스트 항 상점에서 산 저렴한 치즈를 같이 끓이는 건데...","source_cn":"从村外树林里采摘回来的新鲜野菜，自家捕的鱼，还有锈锚港...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02BB61866B3024CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1222560011":{"text":"마을 밖 숲에서 가져온 신선한 채소와 직접 잡은 생선, 그리고 러스트 항 상점에서 산 저렴한 치즈를 같이 끓이는 건데...","source_cn":"从村外树林里采摘回来的新鲜野菜，自家捕的鱼，还有锈锚港商铺里买到的廉价芝士，全部炖在一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02BB61866B3024CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222560012:1":{"text":"진짜 맛없었어!","source_cn":"难吃得很！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3762C6D5096B7A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222560014:0":{"text":"그땐 돈이 없어서 정제 소금을 못 샀거든. 그래서 집에 있는 건 햇볕에 바닷물을 직접 말려서 얻은 조잡한 소금뿐이었어. 그걸 채소와 치즈에 넣고 끓이면 세상에서 가장 맛없는 괴식이 탄생하곤 했지!","source_cn":"那时候村里没钱买精盐，都是自家晒的粗制海盐。配上菜叶子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA65573EC1F71CBA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222560015:0":{"text":"하지만 그때가 조금 그립긴 해.","source_cn":"但是，我很怀念。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x983A5E353E02EA7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222560016:1":{"text":"언젠가 항해를 떠날 거야. 그날이 멀지 않았고.","source_cn":"我迟早会扬帆远航，那一天不会太远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9FC932B2C198439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222560017:0":{"text":"그 전에 마지막으로 마을 사람들이랑 모여서 눈물 날만큼 맛없는 음식을 함께 먹는다면...","source_cn":"要是能在最后和村里的大家聚在一起，吃一顿难吃到能让人哭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8514B7A39B8AD94F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222560018:0":{"text":"그것도 나쁘지 않을 것 같네.","source_cn":"我想，那还不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32AB5E75118E1711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222560019:1":{"text":"저게 신밧드의 소원이네요. 놀라울 정도로 예상을 벗어났죠?","source_cn":"这就是辛巴达的愿望，非常出人意料，是不是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x367F6D2192C2AC6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222560020:1":{"text":"어떤 사람들은 자신의 마음을 똑바로 마주하기 어려워해요. 그걸 배운다는 건 쉬운 일이 아니거든요.","source_cn":"不过有些人就是会口是心非。看来学会正视自己的内心，并不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5E13EB44048FD94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1222560021:1":{"text":"수면 가루도 다 뿌렸어요. 계속 함정을 파보자고요!","source_cn":"催眠的鳞粉也洒好了。我们继续布置陷阱吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F83E462A31E1DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"맛있어?","source_cn":"好吃吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9756AD9B2AE864B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맛있어?","female":"맛있어?","variant_male_record_index":"67316","variant_female_record_index":"67317","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1222560013:1":{"text":"하하하하, 그렇지? 지금 생각하면 진짜 신기하다니까? 내가 그런 걸 먹으면서 자랐다니!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，对吧！现在想想真是不可思议，我就是吃那些杂烩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11FD460865AE480E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"제발, 그건 또 무슨 괴식이야?!","source_cn":"救命，那是什么黑暗料理？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF70E5DE82F854E81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_t